---
// Homepage hero, 2026-09-23. Full screen under the nav. The photo is the section's own background
// (hero-figure.webp, which fades to transparent at its edges; never convert it to JPEG or the fade turns white).
---
<section class="dk hero">
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="hero-body"><div class="wrap" style="width:100%"><div class="hero-copy">
    <h1>What drives<br />our decisions<em>.</em></h1>
    <p class="lede">Answers arrive in seconds now. I help you and your team build the judgment that turns them into decisions.</p>
    <div class="acts">
      <a class="ulink" href="/services">Work with me &nbsp;→</a>
      <button type="button" class="play" id="intro-open"><span><svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M8 5v14l11-7z" /></svg></span>Watch a 55-second intro</button>
    </div>
  </div></div></div>
  <div class="hero-foot"><div class="wrap"><b>New York</b><span>Finance · Artificial Intelligence · Education</span></div></div>
</section>

<style is:global>
  .hero .play { background: none; border: 0; font: inherit; padding: 0; }
</style>
